  "body": "This patch documents find-in-page, which is an existing behavior in major browsers.\n\nThe PR defines some commonly used terms which are helpful to reference in other parts of the spec\n\nPlease see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3539 for further details.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/ac285c0...c225ac1/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/dnd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">/dnd.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/ac285c0...c225ac1/dnd.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/ac285c0...c225ac1/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/ac285c0...c225ac1/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5770/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 10, 2020, 9:46 PM UTC (c225ac1)\">/interacti